argus ml benchmark          # about 3 minutes
argus report course         # re-renders this file and its figures
```

The report refuses to render if any analysis output was computed from different data (fingerprint `{{ fp.sha256 }}`) or from a quick run. The interactive explorer is generated with `argus report explorer` (`docs/explorer/index.html`).

